{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id176607584"}, "name":{"label":"Oakvilleappl"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-05-21T19:24:54-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.0.2"}, "id":{"label":"1620557419"}, "title":{"label":"Disappointed and upset"}, "content":{"label":"There is a major oversight in this app you cannot move things from your inbox to the new anytime category. In the things 2 app you could move from the inbox to next but now magically that functionality doesn't exist and you can only go from your inbox to today or Someday and that just doesn't work for me.\n\n#UPDATE#\nSwipe left/no project works to send to Anytime.\n\nOnly missing thing now is on the Watch app / to get the ability to add new items directly to today.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"2"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"2"}}, 
