{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id42146850"}, "name":{"label":"CPTPaul04"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-05-21T11:50:28-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.0.2"}, "id":{"label":"1620340077"}, "title":{"label":"Most aesthetically pleasing todo app"}, "content":{"label":"So I've been using the iOS versions of this app the last few days and have found it very pleasing and streamlined. Other GTD apps go so far into the details that you spend more time organizing and reviewing your todos than actually doing them.\n\nThings 3 brings a very fun whiteboard effect to organizing todos that I love, especially the addition of headers within projects, it actually feels like I'm playing with a whiteboard.\n\nTo get 5 stars there are 2 features that I think would bring this GTD app to number 1:\n\n- update the existing tags infrastructure in the iOS app so that on top of the drop down list users can begin to type the tag which will isolate a tag on a long list or offer the option to create a new one, this will greatly enhance the use of tags in iOS much like on the Mac version. Similarly, an easy way to select multiple todos and add a tag to all selected todos would be awesome. The current alternative is to add a tag one by one (cumbersome), or resort to the MacOS version and use a short key.\n\n- this is the biggest feature that would GREATLY increase the paying user base: Web Browser support to view, add and edit todos!! As someone who loves iOS and MacOS, but works for the government I am restrained to the windows system, and not allowed to download private software, and sometimes not even allowed my phone. I know this is a similar issue for many professionals. Being able to access a web browser interface through our cloud login like with iCloud reminders, Evernote or Microsoft Cloud would be HUGE!!!\n\nI should say, a little pricey, a combined iOS app at $20 total for both iPhone and iPad would make it easier to take the plunge on iOS and macOS. Until then, still an awesome app, 4 stars out of 5!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id112488301"}, "name":{"label":"Mic8ael2013"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-05-21T11:14:36-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.0.2"}, "id":{"label":"1620324717"}, "title":{"label":"Looks great"}, "content":{"label":"Been a long time user of things. The update brings a lot of great new features while keeping everything good from the old. Well done!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id43020150"}, "name":{"label":"Ruby Topaz"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-05-21T10:02:15-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.0.2"}, "id":{"label":"1620290130"}, "title":{"label":"One Device Is Enough"}, "content":{"label":"I have been a Things user since its inception. I purchased and enjoyed using the desktop, iPad and iPhone versions. The price point for the Things v3 was acceptable and I really enjoy the new look and functionality. And that is the reason I have given the app a 5 star rating. However, given the price of the iPad and desktop versions I will not be purchasing them. Nearly $100  to keep my devices in syn is just not worth it.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
