{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id201883057"}, "name":{"label":"Raoul2015"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-05-20T21:00:33-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.0.2"}, "id":{"label":"1619695188"}, "title":{"label":"Nouvelle version emballante"}, "content":{"label":"J'utilisais depuis plusieurs mois la version précédente, je dois dire que je suis très content d'avoir la migré à la version 3! L'interface est encore plus conviviale, l'application est très polyvalente et s'intègre parfaitement dans la gestion de mes activités.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id322890219"}, "name":{"label":"ET_2018"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-05-20T16:58:44-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.0.2"}, "id":{"label":"1619515423"}, "title":{"label":"Love!"}, "content":{"label":"Usually only a paper person for to-do lists, but this system is so well designed. Not bloated at all.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id42037050"}, "name":{"label":"dfpw007"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-05-19T23:42:37-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.0.2"}, "id":{"label":"1618861388"}, "title":{"label":"Fantastic update!"}, "content":{"label":"I've used things 2 since launch and this update is even better. Great job guys! Thanks for focusing on app quality instead of money grabs.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id36618936"}, "name":{"label":"JaronL"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-05-19T21:50:06-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.0.2"}, "id":{"label":"1618758430"}, "title":{"label":"Nailed it!"}, "content":{"label":"Things is kinda my life. It helps me do what I say I'll do, and accomplish my goals. Things 3 gets it all right. It's clean, simple, and a pleasure to use, just like a GTD system should be, so you can focus on getting things done!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id104021756"}, "name":{"label":"KevinHuska"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-05-19T20:56:32-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.0.2"}, "id":{"label":"1618712381"}, "title":{"label":"Very happy with Things 3"}, "content":{"label":"I have been using Things since 2009.  Things Cloud made syncing smooth for Things 2. Now with Things 3 syncing is even faster. Upgrading and converting was fast, and all my tasks, projects and areas converted perfectly. The iphone app is so robust with a full set of features.  I love that you can create a task and make a checklist within it. If you realize it is really a project, you can convert it to a project right on your iphone (and the check list becomes individual tasks in the project). Tags and search features are nicely done. I don't spend much time fiddling with the app to get my tasks \"right\", Cultred Code made that part easy, so I can spend my time getting things done. The price is worth it. Paid about the same 8 years ago... works out to pennies a day a for both the ios and Mac apps. I am Very happy with Things 3 and you will be too!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"3"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"3"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id49202174"}, "name":{"label":"Pennino"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-05-19T14:55:30-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.0.2"}, "id":{"label":"1618466319"}, "title":{"label":"Brilliant!"}, "content":{"label":"Brilliant, sharp & refreshing!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id24245418"}, "name":{"label":"Cryolathe"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-05-19T14:11:50-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.0.1"}, "id":{"label":"1618450071"}, "title":{"label":"Missing iCloud Stnc"}, "content":{"label":"Nicely designed app; I'm not yet convinced it will replace Calendars 5 but there is no question that Things is very slick. \n\nOne strange design choice is that Things does not use iCloud for syncing. Instead it uses its own proprietary 'Things Cloud' for which you have to sign up (free). \n\nI'd much rather trust iCloud with my data than sending it through some 3rd party with unknown security. \n\nHopefully iCloud support is on their 'things to do soon' list.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"3"}}, 
